{
  "book": "2CO",
  "chapter": 13,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "marker": "p",
      "role": "scripture",
      "sourceId": "engylt_usfx.xml#book[@id=\"2CO\"]/p[31]",
      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "1",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.1",
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.1"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "This third time do I come unto you; on the mouth of two witnesses or three shall every saying be established;\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.1",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.1"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.1",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.1"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.1"
        },
        {
          "verse": "2",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.2",
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.2"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.2"
        },
        {
          "text": "I have said before, and I say [it] before, as being present, the second time, and being absent, now, do I write to those having sinned before, and to all the rest, that if I come again, I will not spare,\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.2",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.2"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.2"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.2",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.2"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.2"
        },
        {
          "verse": "3",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.3",
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.3"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.3"
        },
        {
          "text": "since a proof ye seek of the Christ speaking in me, who to you is not infirm, but is powerful in you,\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.3",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.3"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.3"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.3",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.3"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.3"
        },
        {
          "verse": "4",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.4",
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.4"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.4"
        },
        {
          "text": "for even if he was crucified from infirmity, yet he doth live from the power of God; for we also are weak in him, but we shall live with him from the power of God toward you.\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.4",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.4"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.4"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.4",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.4"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.4"
        },
        {
          "verse": "5",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.5",
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.5"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.5"
        },
        {
          "text": "Your own selves try ye, if ye are in the faith; your own selves prove ye; do ye not know your own selves, that Jesus Christ is in you, if ye be not in some respect disapproved of?\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.5",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.5"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.5"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.5",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.5"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.5"
        },
        {
          "verse": "6",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.6",
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.6"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.6"
        },
        {
          "text": "and I hope that ye shall know that we — we are not disapproved of;\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.6",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.6"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.6"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.6",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.6"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.6"
        },
        {
          "verse": "7",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.7",
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.7"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.7"
        },
        {
          "text": "and I pray before God that ye do no evil, not that we may appear approved, but that ye may do that which is right, and we may be as disapproved;\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.7",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.7"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.7"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.7",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.7"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.7"
        },
        {
          "verse": "8",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.8",
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.8"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.8"
        },
        {
          "text": "for we are not able to do anything against the truth, but for the truth;\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.8",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.8"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.8"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.8",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.8"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.8"
        },
        {
          "verse": "9",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.9",
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.9"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.9"
        },
        {
          "text": "for we rejoice when we may be infirm, and ye may be powerful; and this also we pray for — your perfection!\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.9",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.9"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.9"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.9",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.9"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.9"
        },
        {
          "verse": "10",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.10",
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.10"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.10"
        },
        {
          "text": "because of this, these things — being absent — I write, that being present, I may not treat [any] sharply, according to the authority that the Lord did give me for building up, and not for casting down.\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.10",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.10"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.10"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.10",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.10"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.10"
        },
        {
          "verse": "11",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.11",
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.11"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Henceforth, brethren, rejoice; be made perfect, be comforted, be of the same mind, be at peace, and the God of the love and peace shall be with you;\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.11",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.11"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.11"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.11",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.11"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.11"
        },
        {
          "verse": "12",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.12",
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.12"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.12"
        },
        {
          "text": "salute one another in an holy kiss;\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.12",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.12"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.12"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.12",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.12"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.12"
        },
        {
          "verse": "13",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.13",
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.13"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.13"
        },
        {
          "text": "salute you do all the saints;\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.13",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.13"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.13"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.13",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.13"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.13"
        },
        {
          "verse": "14",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.14",
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.14"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.14"
        },
        {
          "text": "the grace of the Lord Jesus Christ, and the love of God, and the fellowship of the Holy Spirit, [is] with you all! Amen.\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.14",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "2CO.13.14"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "2CO.13.14"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "2CO.13.14",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
